    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113633" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρό-κμητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wrought by hand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραδείγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ti.Locr.
					94e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				287b16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				381a30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.5.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ὕδατα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρεατιαῖα</span>
			, of <i>artificial</i> reservoirs, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				353b25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					4.2
				</span></i>
			; neut. pl. as title of work by [<i><span class="en">
				Democr.
			</span></i>], <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				300
			</span></i> (variously corrupted).</div>
